menu "P4-NANO display diagnostic"

config P4_NANO_DISPLAY_RUN_HARDWARE_TEST
    bool "Run the physical MIPI-DSI display test"
    default n
    help
        Enable only after the LCD FPC, separate display power, and the
        mechanical protection bracket have been checked with power off.
        When disabled, the application performs only the offline framebuffer
        self-test and does not access DSI, JD9365, or the display I2C bus.

endmenu
